title hiipdr (Bisbas et al. 2015 sec 5.4): Cloudy equivalent of MOCASSIN runs/d263-chex
init "common.inc"
# ---- dust: MOCASSIN astroSilD2003, MRN 0.01-0.30 um slope -3.5 (compiled into
# sdraine03_hiipdr_10.opc). Abundance scaled so A_V(point)/N_H = 5.177e-22,
# MOCASSIN's measured mean (D-109 log line of runs/d263-chex): 3.048e-22 at
# scale 1 -> factor 1.698. Matching the dust MASS (MdMg 0.011295) instead would
# give 1.57x the grain cross-section, because Cloudy's rfi material density
# (2.228 g/cm3) differs from MOCASSIN's.
grains "sdraine03_hiipdr_10.opc" 0.2300 log
# ---- PDR: no 4000 K stop, run to the outer radius
stop temperature off
set nend 5000
iterate to convergence
# ---- output (last iteration)
save overview last "hiipdr.ovr"
save pdr last "hiipdr.pdr"
save grain temperature last "hiipdr.gtemp"
save species densities last "hiipdr.dens"
e-
H+
H
H2
He+
He+2
C+
C+2
C
O+
O+2
O
Mg+
CO
OH
H2O
CH
HCO+
H3+
end
